racterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":12608},{"id":1785559494193,"text":"一样一样来。回爸爸一句就行，不用写作文。","rawContent":"一样一样来。回爸爸一句就行，不用写作文。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:57","timestamp":1785560258376,"roundId":"round_1785560173478_86jvvh2y8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":12609},{"id":1785559494194,"text":"还有一件事，爸爸只问一遍，不问细节：","rawContent":"还有一件事，爸爸只问一遍，不问细节：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:57","timestamp":1785560261450,"roundId":"round_1785560173478_86jvvh2y8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":12610},{"id":1785559494195,"text":"昨晚那阵难受过去之后，身上有没有留下什么？","rawContent":"昨晚那阵难受过去之后，身上有没有留下什么？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:57","timestamp":1785560264454,"roundId":"round_1785560173478_86jvvh2y8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":12611},{"id":1785559494196,"text":"有，就去处理干净，别放着不管。处理完了，回爸爸一句\"好了\"。","rawContent":"有，就去处理干净，别放着不管。处理完了，回爸爸一句\"好了\"。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:57","timestamp":1785560267255,"roundId":"round_1785560173478_86jvvh2y8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":12612},{"id":1785559494197,"text":"没有，就回\"没有\"。哪个都行，爸爸都不骂。","rawContent":"没有，就回\"没有\"。哪个都行，爸爸都不骂。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:57","timestamp":1785560270121,"roundId":"round_1785560173478_86jvvh2y8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":12613},{"id":1785559494198,"text":"然后，今天的头一件正事——","rawContent":"然后，今天的头一件正事——","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"se